Protaverse 3DS runs inside an Aquamarine Portal (AquamarineMiiverseTeam) and builds on:

  - rverse2 (rverseTeam), Apache License 2.0:
      the 3DS page markup in portal/views/ctr is adapted from its 3DS templates, and
      portal/languages-3ds is converted from its translations (resources/lang).
  - Aquamarine-3DS (AquamarineMiiverseTeam): first 3DS port this project started from.

No proprietary Nintendo code or assets are included in this repository. The 3DS Miiverse
stylesheet, script bundle and images are generated locally by tools/build_n3ds.py from an
rverse2 checkout and are not redistributed here. Miiverse and Nintendo 3DS are trademarks of
Nintendo; this project is not affiliated with Nintendo.
